<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 48,567.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 48,567.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Oct 4 totaled 48,567 bales, up from 47,516 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 1,074 bales issued, no decertification orders, 23 cancellations, and 2,256 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
